":null,"summary":"A hundred kor on kitesails arrive from Tazeem, and Drana decides to welcome them.","participants":["drana","kan","the-kor"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"minor","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":514,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":15,"quote":"\"Welcome. They come to join us at the end of the world. We will be accommodating.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=%22Welcome.%20They%20come%20to,We%20will%20be%20accommodating.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=%22Welcome.%20They%20come%20to,We%20will%20be%20accommodating.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e2","era":null,"summary":"Enkindi, sent by Gideon, invites Drana's army to join Gideon's stand at Sea Gate.","participants":["enkindi","drana","gideon-jura"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":514,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":25,"quote":"\"Win. We can win. Many of you are still strong. We know what you can do in battle. Join us.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=%22Win.%20We%20can%20win.,in%20battle.%20Join%20us.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=%22Win.%20We%20can%20win.,in%20battle.%20Join%20us.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e3","era":null,"summary":"Drana shows Enkindi the Orphans' Brigade of children and proposes he fight with her first before she goes to Sea Gate.","participants":["drana","enkindi","melindra","the-orphans-brigade"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":514,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":42,"quote":"I'll leave with you to fight with Gideon at Sea Gate, if you and your warriors fight with me first.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%27ll%20leave%20with%20you,fight%20with%20me%20first.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%27ll%20leave%20with%20you,fight%20with%20me%20first.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e4","era":null,"summary":"The vampires, mortals and kor battle the three Eldrazi hosts, with the sire as the key target.","participants":["drana","enkindi","the-vampires-of-guul-draz","the-kor","the-eldrazi-sire"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":514,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":52,"quote":"Mortal and vampire alike met the initial onslaught with a fierce savagery.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=Mortal%20and%20vampire%20alike,with%20a%20fierce%20savagery.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=Mortal%20and%20vampire%20alike,with%20a%20fierce%20savagery.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e5","era":null,"summary":"Drana orders the Orphans' Brigade toward the sire as bait; Enkindi calls her a monster but leads his kor at the sire.","participants":["drana","enkindi","kan","the-orphans-brigade"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":514,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":59,"quote":"The children will serve as necessary bait to lure the sire where we need it to be.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=The%20children%20will%20serve,need%20it%20to%20be.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=The%20children%20will%20serve,need%20it%20to%20be.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e6","era":null,"summary":"Enkindi is killed by the Eldrazi sire and the kor are slaughtered.","participants":["enkindi","the-eldrazi-sire","the-kor"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":514,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":64,"quote":"Enkindi's headless corpse, still attached to its broken kitesail, plummeted uselessly to the ground.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=Enkindi%27s%20headless%20corpse%2C%20still,uselessly%20to%20the%20ground.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=Enkindi%27s%20headless%20corpse%2C%20still,uselessly%20to%20the%20ground.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e7","era":null,"summary":"Drana bores into the sire's heart and drinks its energy, recovering memories of her origin as a creature of Ulamog.","participants":["drana","the-eldrazi-sire","ulamog"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":514,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":72,"quote":"I was no longer an extension of it, of the consuming force named Ulamog.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20was%20no%20longer,consuming%20force%20named%20Ulamog.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20was%20no%20longer,consuming%20force%20named%20Ulamog.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e8","era":null,"summary":"The Eldrazi energy overwhelms Drana, but she reasserts herself with 'I serve no one' and consumes the energy.","participants":["drana","the-eldrazi-sire"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":514,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":90,"quote":"I serve no one! I will be free!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20serve%20no%20one%21%20I%20will%20be%20free%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20serve%20no%20one%21%20I%20will%20be%20free%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e9","era":null,"summary":"Drana releases the Eldrazi energy as a magenta sun that heals her army and destroys the Eldrazi, then collapses.","participants":["drana","melindra","the-vampires-of-guul-draz","eldrazi"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":514,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":98,"quote":"I belong to no one . . . but they belong to me.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20belong%20to%20no,th